    aiContent: {
      difficulty: {
        easy: 'Plays randomly. Ignores patterns. Makes no attempt to track suits. Arranges won tiles without strategy.',
        medium: 'Tracks which suits have been revealed. Attempts to remember opponent positions and suit matches. Makes minimal strategic placement of won tiles.',
        hard: 'Maintains a partial count of revealed dominoes. Tracks which suits are more/less likely in unseen tiles. Positions won dominoes strategically to maximize future matching potential. Recognizes patterns in lead suits and adjusts expectations.',
      },
      considerations: [
        'This is primarily a luck-based game, limiting AI advantage.',
        'AI can improve odds only by better tracking of revealed tiles and suit probability.',
        'Arranging won tiles strategically in the line is the only tactical element.',
      ],
    },
