          human: 'Welcome to Freeze-Out Dominoes! You are playing a simple matching game. On your turn, reveal your rightmost domino. Try to match the suits from the lead tile to win the trick and collect all dominoes revealed. Be the first to gather all dominoes and you win!',
          ai: "Game: Freeze-Out Dominoes (Children's Domino Game). Setup: Double-six dominoes, evenly distributed to 2-6 players; extras removed. Turn Sequence: Lead player reveals rightmost domino and announces its suits. Other players reveal their rightmost dominoes in turn. Trick Winner: Player whose domino matches one of the lead suits collects all revealed dominoes. Collected dominoes placed at left of line, face-down. Next Lead: Trick winner leads the next round. Game End: Last player remaining with dominoes wins. Win Condition: Accumulate all dominoes.",
